            "title": "Disney reaches new deal with YouTube TV, ending a blackout that lasted over two weeks",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Disney and YouTube TV reached a new deal to bring channels like ABC and ESPN back to the Google-owned livestreaming platform Friday, ending a blackout for customers that dragged on for over two weeks.  \u201cAs part of the new deal, Disney\u2019s full suite of networks and stations \u2014 including ESPN and ABC \u2014 have already begun to be restored to YouTube TV subscribers,\u201d The Walt Disney Co. said in a statement.  YouTube TV also confirmed the return of Disney content on its platform, noting that subscribers should see channels back \u201cover the course of the day.\u201d",
